   "body": "/claim cloud/fb-quickwins-sonnet\n\nPlan (one PR, red test first):\n- `IconWindow.contains` and `lastEndYear` read month, day and year through `NoelCalendar.gregorian(in: calendar.timeZone)`, as the Noël theme does, so the icon windows and the `<icon>:<year>` token never follow the device calendar.\n- Test `iconWindowsAreGregorianWhateverTheDeviceCalendar` from the issue (Islamic Umm al-Qura calendar, 10 Dec 2026 in the 12/01–12/26 window; `lastEndYear` on 3 Jan 2027 is 2026), plus the season model's launch check on a non-Gregorian calendar.\n- Overlap checked with the open PRs #1226/#1227/#1229/#1231/#1240/#1241/#1243: none touches `AppIcon*` or `NoelCalendar`.\n- Draft PR with `compile-check`, Opus adversarial review, ready line on #893.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
